@@ -21802,6 +21802,14 @@ static void reaper_gate_deny(FILE *stream, int why, const char *ns)
  * cfg_server then performs the fronthaul/backhaul split off the same
  * restart_wireless the stock page fires; nothing about that path is touched.
  *
+ * v3.2.9: the box also runs the SDN reconcile every stock SDN writer runs
+ * (create_sdn_mwl_profile, the guest-network apply, rc's check_sdn_onoff):
+ * sync_apgx_to_wlunit() before the commit, restart_sdn after restart_wireless
